# panel-card-hoenn 128x80. W10-C T2 cutscene panel (Class F
# card): the ARC COMPLETE card for arc hoenn. Original
# in-house art, generated deterministically by w10c-rig/
# gen-panels-t2.mjs. Brief = the arc record: "Perennial
# Conference — HONOURS." / "Two storms called and answered,
# eight badges earned, and a conference run that ended narrow
# and proud." Two storm systems flank a narrow calm channel:
# a rain bank west, a waterspout east, and between them still
# water and a light path to the home headland; eight badge
# glints on the near shore = the recorded eight badges.
